---
---

<section id="problem">
  <!-- Plus Corner Markers -->
  <div class="section-corner-marker marker-tl">+</div>
  <div class="section-corner-marker marker-tr">+</div>
  <div class="section-corner-marker marker-bl">+</div>
  <div class="section-corner-marker marker-br">+</div>

  <!-- Background Watermark -->
  <div class="bg-watermark-right">BRAIN</div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-animate>
      <div class="section-label">
        <span class="number">01 · CONTEXT</span>
        <span class="line"></span>
        <span class="tag">Problem & Approach</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="section-title text-gradient-coral">Manual review is slow, subjective, and scarce</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Brain tumors are visually heterogeneous and radiologist review is time-consuming, 
        reader-dependent, and limited by specialist availability in low-resource settings. 
        An automated CNN classifier can pre-rank scans, flag high-confidence cases, and 
        augment — not replace — clinical review.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-grid">
      <!-- Bottleneck card -->
      <div class="bottleneck-card glass" data-animate>
        <!-- Corner Plus Markers inside glass card -->
        <div class="section-corner-marker marker-tl">+</div>
        <div class="section-corner-marker marker-br">+</div>

        <div class="card-header">
          <span class="card-icon danger">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"/><path d="M12 9v4"/><path d="M12 17h.01"/></svg>
          </span>
          <h3>The bottleneck</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="card-text">
          We frame this as a 4-class image classification task on T1-weighted contrast MRI. 
          The clinical goal is to surface the scans most likely to need urgent specialist 
          attention — not to issue a diagnosis.
        </p>
        <ul class="pain-points">
          <li><span class="dot"></span>Reader-dependent interpretation</li>
          <li><span class="dot"></span>Long turnaround in low-resource settings</li>
          <li><span class="dot"></span>Visually heterogeneous tumor morphology</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Solution cards -->
      <div class="solutions">
        <div class="solution-card glass" data-animate>
          <div class="section-corner-marker marker-tr">+</div>
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--cyan)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m10 20-1.25-2.5L6 18"/><path d="M10 4 8.75 6.5 6 6"/><path d="m14 20 1.25-2.5L18 18"/><path d="m14 4 1.25 2.5L18 6"/><path d="m17 21-3-6h-4"/><path d="m17 3-3 6 1.5 3"/><path d="M2 12h6.5L10 9"/><path d="m20 10-1.5 2 1.5 2"/><path d="M22 12h-6.5L14 15"/><path d="m4 10 1.5 2L4 14"/><path d="m7 21 3-6-1.5-3"/><path d="m7 3 3 6h4"/></svg>
          <h4>Frozen backbone</h4>
          <p>Reuse a deep ImageNet-pretrained VGG19 backbone for visual feature extraction. Backprop never touches the conv weights.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-card glass" data-animate>
          <div class="section-corner-marker marker-tl">+</div>
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--amber)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"/><path d="M20 3v4"/><path d="M22 5h-4"/><path d="M4 17v2"/><path d="M5 18H3"/></svg>
          <h4>Fresh dense head</h4>
          <p>Train a task-specific head — 2× Dense(4096) + softmax — on brain MRI to learn tumor-specific decision boundaries.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="solution-card glass" data-animate>
          <div class="section-corner-marker marker-br">+</div>
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"/></svg>
          <h4>Multi-metric</h4>
          <p>Track accuracy, precision, recall & AUC jointly — never accuracy alone — for an honest clinical picture.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Transfer Learning Flow -->
    <div class="flow-bar glass" data-animate>
      <div class="section-corner-marker marker-tl">+</div>
      <div class="section-corner-marker marker-br">+</div>
      <div class="flow-label font-mono">TRANSFER LEARNING FLOW</div>
      <div class="pill-flow">
        <span class="pill">ImageNet</span>
        <span class="pill-arrow">→</span>
        <span class="pill">VGG19 conv</span>
        <span class="pill-arrow">→</span>
        <span class="pill">Flatten</span>
        <span class="pill-arrow">→</span>
        <span class="pill">Dense×2</span>
        <span class="pill-arrow">→</span>
        <span class="pill">Softmax(4)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 96px 0 120px;
  }

  .section-header {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 3fr;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .problem-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .bottleneck-card {
    padding: 28px;
    border-color: rgba(255, 83, 112, 0.2);
    height: 100%;
  }

  .card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .card-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 10px;
  }

  .card-icon.danger {
    background: rgba(255, 83, 112, 0.12);
    color: var(--red);
  }

  .card-header h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .card-text {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pain-points {
    list-style: none;
    margin-top: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .pain-points li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .pain-points .dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--red);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .solutions {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .solutions {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .solution-card {
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .solution-card svg {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .solution-card h4 {
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .solution-card p {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .flow-bar {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  .flow-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
</style>
